## Arch Linux ARM repository mirrorlist (aarch64)
##
## Only these hosts resolve: the geo endpoint (mirror.archlinuxarm.org) and
## de.mirror.archlinuxarm.org. Per-country subdomains such as
## us.mirror.archlinuxarm.org or ca.mirror.archlinuxarm.org no longer exist
## (DNS NXDOMAIN), so do not add them.
##
## The DE mirror goes first because the geo endpoint applies aggressive
## throttling ("Operation too slow. Less than 1 bytes/sec"), and the geo
## endpoint stays as a fallback. HTTPS is not used: mirror.archlinuxarm.org
## currently serves a certificate for a different name.
Server = http://de.mirror.archlinuxarm.org/$arch/$repo
Server = http://mirror.archlinuxarm.org/$arch/$repo
